  {
    "slide": 28,
    "text": [
      "If two heterozygous black mice are crossed, ",
      "what will be the ",
      "genotypic and phenotypic ratio",
      " of their offspring?",
      "",
      "",
      "?",
      "Genotypic ratio:",
      "",
      " 1  :  2  :  1",
      "BB : Bb : bb",
      "",
      "Pheno",
      "typic ratio:",
      "   3    :    1",
      "Black : brown",
      "Bb x Bb",
      "",
      "\t B      b",
      "",
      "B   BB    Bb",
      "",
      "",
      "b",
      "   Bb    bb",
      "",
      "  ",
      "",
      "",
      "",
      "Note:",
      "A 1:2:1 genotypic ratio and/or a 3:1 phenotypic ratio is highly indicative that we are dealing with a",
      " monohybrid cross, ",
      "which is a cross between two organisms that are ",
      "both heterozygous for a single trait",
      ".",
      ""
