  {
    "slide": 31,
    "text": [
      "Test Crosses",
      "An individual with the dominant phenotype could be either homozygous (BB) or heterozygous (Bb). By performing a ",
      "test cross",
      ", we can determine the true genotype of such individuals.",
      "Cross the unknown individual (B",
      "?",
      ")",
      " with an individual who displays the ",
      "recessive phenotype (bb)",
      " ",
      "(because their genotype is known):",
      "If the unknown was homozygous, all offspring will show dominant phenotype",
      "If heterozygous, ",
      "some (typically half) ",
      "offspring will show recessive phenotype",
      "There are two possible outcomes:"
    ],
    "images": [
      {
        "relationshipId": "rId3",
        "archiveMember": "ppt/media/image22.png",
        "file": "sources/slide-assets/slide-31-image22.png",
